The '''Red Claw Egg''' is an {{Epic}} Crafting Material dropped from the [[Sven Packmaster]] {{SlayerTier|III}}+. It is used to craft the [[Red Claw Artifact]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
The Red Claw Egg is a {{O|rng|no=y}} drop from {{Stier|3}} or higher [[Sven Packmaster]]s. It requires {{Coll|Wolf Slayer LVL 5}} to be able to drop.
